# Normalize all text files to LF in blobs; checkout EOL follows core.autocrlf/eol.
# Ends the CRLF working-tree vs LF-blob diff tax (every live-vs-repo diff needed tr -d '\r').
* text=auto
# Shell scripts and the Makefile are LF in every working tree: Git Bash / bash reject
# CRLF (`$'\r': command not found`), and a fresh Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true
# (Git for Windows default, GitHub's windows runners) would otherwise check them out CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
